<title>THAILAND: BOXING-SINGMANASSUK RETAINS WBC BANTAMWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-SINGMANASSUK RETAINS WBC BANTAMWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Sirimongkol Singmanassuk retained his World Boxing Council (WBC) bantamweight title with a unanimous points decision over Jesus Sarabia of Mexico on Saturday.</p>
</text>
